<!-- ABOUT -->
<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div>
      <div class="section-head">
        <div class="kicker">About me</div>
        <h2>From the classroom to the client brief.</h2>
      </div>
      <p>I'm Aneka Pervez, a primary school teacher with years of classroom experience, now building a parallel career in digital marketing. I hold a Masters in Economics from Fatima Jinnah Women University, Rawalpindi, and have completed practical digital marketing training through Bano Qabil Kahuta and DigiSkills.</p>
